      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Hehe. .. Hehehe ... After all, I am a ropii - a puro in other words! Yeah, right! Just kidding! I'm actually just an ordinary toshiro!",
        "raw": "Hehe. .. Hehehe ... After all, I am a ropii - a puro in other words!\nYeah, right! Just kidding! I'm actually just an ordinary toshiro!",
