    {
      "id": "p0198-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because the same Pyrope character does properly appear at the end of the game with even more rope puns, it made sense for the translator to localize this inaccessible line too. By not skipping it, the translator ensured that Japanese players can appreciate this character's internal consistency if the original programming issues ever get fixed someday.",
        "raw": "Because the same Pyrope character\ndoes properly appear at the end of\nthe game with even more rope puns,\nit made sense for the translator to\nlocalize this inaccessible line too. By\nnot skipping it, the translator ensured\nthat Japanese players can appreciate\nthis character's internal consistency\nif the original programming issues\never get fixed someday.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
